{"id":5440,"date":"2025-09-17T22:59:38","date_gmt":"2025-09-17T15:59:38","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=5440"},"modified":"2025-09-25T20:22:31","modified_gmt":"2025-09-25T13:22:31","slug":"san-xuat-video-tiktok","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/kien-thuc-tiktok\/san-xuat-video-tiktok\/","title":{"rendered":"D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t video TikTok chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"TdBHdYd8GoqF7WxvNr9lNbqYgmb\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X3IvdAN8lomihPx2mXwlOvOhgzb\">Trong b\u1ed1i c\u1ea3nh TikTok \u0111\u00e3 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t k\u00eanh b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 marketing \u0111\u1ea7y quy\u1ec1n n\u0103ng, vi\u1ec7c ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u0103ng t\u1ea3i nh\u1eefng video ng\u1eabu h\u1ee9ng \u0111\u00e3 kh\u00f4ng c\u00f2n \u0111\u1ee7 s\u1ee9c c\u1ea1nh tranh. \u0110\u1ec3 th\u1ef1c s\u1ef1 n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt v\u00e0 chinh ph\u1ee5c kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, c\u00e1c doanh nghi\u1ec7p c\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ebfn m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c n\u1ed9i dung b\u00e0i b\u1ea3n v\u00e0 chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p. \u0110\u1ea7u t\u01b0 v\u00e0o <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/dich-vu\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t video TikTok chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p<\/a><\/strong> ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p t\u1ed1i \u01b0u gi\u00fap th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111\u1ec3 l\u1ea1i d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd v\u00e0 th\u00fac \u0111\u1ea9y t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng. H\u00e3y c\u00f9ng <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong> kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 l\u00fd do t\u1ea1i sao \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t xu h\u01b0\u1edbng t\u1ea5t y\u1ebfu.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J0oWdAM0WoWQefxbe9elfXLbgac\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-K24KdT2o5oZJdsxUPecl7ziegpd\">T\u1ea1i sao s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t video TikTok chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p l\u00e0 xu h\u01b0\u1edbng t\u1ea5t y\u1ebfu c\u1ee7a doanh nghi\u1ec7p?<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MFrbdZmqsoLgr4xVKZTl1WS9gKb\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-XPN9dBr4xoT3BJxSWYLlg4zGgac\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;737cdb61-c233-4ee7-854c-6ea3a02940a2&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FW4Sjb4eTvoPRInxR7N7ltmAWgec%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;W4Sjb4eTvoPRInxR7N7ltmAWgec&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:696773,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5441\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5441\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5441\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-28.png\" alt=\"T\u1ea1i sao s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t video TikTok chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p l\u00e0 xu h\u01b0\u1edbng t\u1ea5t y\u1ebfu c\u1ee7a doanh nghi\u1ec7p?\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-28.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-28-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-28-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-28-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-28-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5441\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>T\u1ea1i sao s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t video TikTok chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p l\u00e0 xu h\u01b0\u1edbng t\u1ea5t y\u1ebfu c\u1ee7a doanh nghi\u1ec7p?<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O40kdHIB9oMfPVxDMoWl14VHgye\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SACxd3zMMo2mQwxqPBelOeVpgGm\">S\u00e2n ch\u01a1i TikTok ng\u00e0y c\u00e0ng tr\u1edf n\u00ean chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p h\u01a1n. Ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng hi\u1ec7n nay c\u00f3 y\u00eau c\u1ea7u cao h\u01a1n v\u1ec1 ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng n\u1ed9i dung, h\u1ecd mong \u0111\u1ee3i nh\u1eefng video kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 gi\u1ea3i tr\u00ed m\u00e0 c\u00f2n mang l\u1ea1i gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb, c\u00f3 h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh \u0111\u1eb9p m\u1eaft v\u00e0 \u00e2m thanh s\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ed9ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QjU2d0YOBowfmRxGGmrlGRbkgHd\">\u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi doanh nghi\u1ec7p, video TikTok kh\u00f4ng c\u00f2n \u0111\u01a1n thu\u1ea7n l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t k\u00eanh t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c m\u00e0 \u0111\u00e3 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec3m ch\u1ea1m quan tr\u1ecdng trong h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh mua h\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a kh\u00e1ch. M\u1ed9t video \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 b\u00e0i b\u1ea3n s\u1ebd th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ef1 chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p c\u1ee7a th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u, t\u1ea1o d\u1ef1ng ni\u1ec1m tin v\u00e0 t\u00e1c \u0111\u1ed9ng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp \u0111\u1ebfn quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh mua h\u00e0ng, \u0111i\u1ec1u m\u00e0 nh\u1eefng video t\u1ef1 quay \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n kh\u00f3 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 l\u00e0m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZmJJd5TGhoYyCmxK0qPlZEWYgoh\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-VDUfdc06noK4kwx14uRlVJ9ogyc\">L\u1ee3i \u00edch khi \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t video TikTok<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FseddmYBhozGOsxnOlRll7Arggh\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-HV9kdZ0FSoAJHDxaB5SlEWGpgRc\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;e58fd587-cf7f-4e06-b90c-9bafae340eb2&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FIt8lbwM0GoUbqFxV3tDle7L7gxg%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;It8lbwM0GoUbqFxV3tDle7L7gxg&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:774619,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5442\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5442\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-5442 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-29.png\" alt=\"L\u1ee3i \u00edch khi \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t video TikTok\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-29.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-29-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-29-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-29-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-29-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5442\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">L\u1ee3i \u00edch khi \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t video TikTok<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WLVVdUhFkos3paxwzQLlPUbfggg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>N\u00e2ng cao h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u:<\/strong> Video ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng cao v\u1edbi k\u1ecbch b\u1ea3n s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o, g\u00f3c quay \u0111\u1eb9p v\u00e0 h\u1eadu k\u1ef3 chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p gi\u00fap x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh m\u1ed9t th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u uy t\u00edn, \u0111\u00e1ng tin c\u1eady trong m\u1eaft kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NuGmdbbcuoE44GxDtbslq78hg9f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>T\u0103ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i:<\/strong> M\u1ed9t video \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p c\u00f3 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng truy\u1ec1n t\u1ea3i th\u00f4ng \u0111i\u1ec7p s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng v\u00e0 thuy\u1ebft ph\u1ee5c h\u01a1n, t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3 tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp th\u00fac \u0111\u1ea9y m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau t\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem, l\u01b0\u1ee3t theo d\u00f5i v\u00e0 t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i (conversion).<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NB9AdmKN5okyDrxzh5IlcpCugM0\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o tu\u00e2n th\u1ee7 ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch:<\/strong> C\u00e1c \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p nh\u01b0 Lemon Digital lu\u00f4n c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt v\u00e0 am hi\u1ec3u ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch c\u1ee7a n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng, gi\u00fap n\u1ed9i dung video c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n tr\u00e1nh \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u00e1c l\u1ed7i vi ph\u1ea1m, h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf nguy c\u01a1 b\u1ecb tr\u1eeb \u0111i\u1ec3m ho\u1eb7c x\u00f3a k\u00eanh.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-H8yZdwcBEoq3TPxgkjclXhqXgEh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Ti\u1ebft ki\u1ec7m th\u1eddi gian v\u00e0 ngu\u1ed3n l\u1ef1c:<\/strong> Thay v\u00ec ph\u1ea3i t\u1ef1 m\u00e0y m\u00f2 t\u1eeb l\u00ean \u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng, quay phim \u0111\u1ebfn d\u1ef1ng video, vi\u1ec7c h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c v\u1edbi m\u1ed9t \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p gi\u00fap doanh nghi\u1ec7p ti\u1ebft ki\u1ec7m th\u1eddi gian, c\u00f4ng s\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1eadp trung v\u00e0o c\u00e1c ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng kinh doanh c\u1ed1t l\u00f5i.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CAXidRZEZocAsDx4YuTlqWllguE\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-MK8wdBL7Yo1VIexQeJ8ljjT1gQe\">D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t video TikTok t\u1ea1i Lemon Digital<\/h2>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JGEtdI5RjoBxO6xKtHglE367gwh\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_5443\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5443\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5443\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-30.png\" alt=\"D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t video TikTok t\u1ea1i Lemon Digital\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-30.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-30-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-30-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-30-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-30-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5443\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t video TikTok t\u1ea1i Lemon Digital<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"TdBHdYd8GoqF7WxvNr9lNbqYgmb\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-CI3AdjBcIowwNzxchf7lkJqagxd\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;309410ca-6167-40a6-9963-cb7a20d6dc8f&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FUh2KbsiBBo0jVOxlf0ZlPSMHgOc%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Uh2KbsiBBo0jVOxlf0ZlPSMHgOc&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:792151,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TtMtdJ7edoSL3GxgYAIlg1PzgEV\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HiEidgbGGoLypXxsbNxlKs9igbg\">Hi\u1ec3u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nhu c\u1ea7u c\u1ee7a th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng,<strong> Lemon Digital cung c\u1ea5p gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t video \u0111a n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t t\u1ed1i \u01b0u cho TikTok Shop<\/strong> v\u1edbi m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau kinh doanh b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3. D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 tr\u1ecdn g\u00f3i c\u1ee7a ch\u00fang t\u00f4i bao g\u1ed3m:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UHN8dH0sOop5Jdxvb4IlSpFagHb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110\u1ecbnh h\u01b0\u1edbng v\u00e0 s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung:<\/strong> T\u01b0 v\u1ea5n v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecbnh h\u01b0\u1edbng n\u1ed9i dung ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi mong mu\u1ed1n c\u1ee7a kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eb7c th\u00f9 ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JDupdCkNCoWdMBxRTmUl6ajkgQh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Vi\u1ebft k\u1ecbch b\u1ea3n chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p:<\/strong> X\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng k\u1ecbch b\u1ea3n chi ti\u1ebft, s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WJj3d8KUhorwXYxCrTtlwj5sgsf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Ki\u1ec3m tra n\u1ed9i dung:<\/strong> \u0110\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o n\u1ed9i dung tu\u00e2n th\u1ee7 \u0111\u00fang ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch c\u1ee7a n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng TikTok.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VL4YdSnhbosrMnxEyFCldjYCgjh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Setup b\u1ed1i c\u1ea3nh:<\/strong> Cung c\u1ea5p b\u1ed1i c\u1ea3nh c\u00f3 s\u1eb5n t\u1ea1i studio chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MNQvdYYL4oNW6SxGM3XlPLEwgD8\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Di\u1ec5n vi\u00ean chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p:<\/strong> H\u1ee3p t\u00e1c c\u00f9ng c\u00e1c di\u1ec5n vi\u00ean xinh x\u1eafn, c\u00f3 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng di\u1ec5n xu\u1ea5t t\u1ed1t \u0111\u1ec3 truy\u1ec1n t\u1ea3i th\u00f4ng \u0111i\u1ec7p m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean v\u00e0 thu h\u00fat.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EzFJd1XVxoJUJkxOIK0lxS4Gg0f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>S\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t v\u00e0 h\u1eadu k\u1ef3:<\/strong> Th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n quay phim, d\u1ef1ng phim, th\u00eam text minh h\u1ecda, nh\u1ea1c n\u1ec1n, l\u1ed3ng ti\u1ebfng, hi\u1ec7u \u1ee9ng c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n v\u00e0 thumbnail h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U5T7dc408oWjrqx5CwSlYGd6gqh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>B\u00e0n giao v\u00e0 ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda:<\/strong> B\u00e0n giao th\u00e0nh ph\u1ea9m video d\u1ea1ng d\u1ecdc chu\u1ea9n TikTok (900x1600px) v\u00e0 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 m\u1ed9t l\u1ea7n ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda (nh\u1ea1c, text, tho\u1ea1i) theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TLrtdS8i1oMXL4xOERClOmVtghd\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-JJE2deaPSokmj5xLl6qlyKU2gvb\">Quy tr\u00ecnh s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t video TikTok r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OfE6dLcs3oklLUxFQhzlEhifgWb\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5444\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5444\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5444\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/40530fdc-b356-418a-8961-549de59d44eb.png\" alt=\"Quy tr\u00ecnh s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t video TikTok r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/40530fdc-b356-418a-8961-549de59d44eb.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/40530fdc-b356-418a-8961-549de59d44eb-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/40530fdc-b356-418a-8961-549de59d44eb-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/40530fdc-b356-418a-8961-549de59d44eb-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/40530fdc-b356-418a-8961-549de59d44eb-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5444\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>Quy tr\u00ecnh s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t video TikTok r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-ExtSdG717owvKbxY2b1lX7FBgWc\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;cc7e1443-6909-42bf-add2-209e37c39d76&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FKS4DbtriWobD3Xxf911lccCngLd%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;KS4DbtriWobD3Xxf911lccCngLd&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:193894,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WkRrdF0yoo0i5MxsyQqlOr3bgDf\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Sesnd2vC1odnVCx6nUllJ6vqg4g\">T\u1ea1i Lemon Digital, ch\u00fang t\u00f4i tri\u1ec3n khai quy tr\u00ecnh l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 minh b\u1ea1ch qua 6 b\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o ti\u1ebfn \u0111\u1ed9 v\u00e0 ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m cu\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-PYvpdUeoxoqcinxts0il210Zg6c\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: Ti\u1ebfp nh\u1eadn y\u00eau c\u1ea7u &amp; T\u01b0 v\u1ea5n<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B1W0di8uao9n4Hx48j4lDaFNgLh\">Lemon Digital ti\u1ebfp nh\u1eadn brief, l\u1eafng nghe mong mu\u1ed1n v\u00e0 m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau c\u1ee7a kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ec3 c\u00f3 c\u00e1i nh\u00ecn t\u1ed5ng quan v\u1ec1 d\u1ef1 \u00e1n.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-BxbSdJsQMoWaXCxNJRpl0ljvgrb\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: L\u00ean k\u1ebf ho\u1ea1ch chi ti\u1ebft &amp; K\u00fd h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ed3ng<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0rQderDsofdSYxHVIElMtBfgZc\">D\u1ef1a tr\u00ean y\u00eau c\u1ea7u, ch\u00fang t\u00f4i s\u1ebd l\u00ean k\u1ebf ho\u1ea1ch s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t chi ti\u1ebft v\u00e0 ti\u1ebfn h\u00e0nh k\u00fd h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ed3ng tri\u1ec3n khai. Giai \u0111o\u1ea1n n\u00e0y th\u01b0\u1eddng m\u1ea5t t\u1eeb 1-2 ng\u00e0y.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-K2nndqLOho0uNkxqYuvlkRlYgUf\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: S\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o k\u1ecbch b\u1ea3n v\u00e0 chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb ti\u1ec1n k\u1ef3<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DbazdI7F2o0Phoxqpegl0Fnpg5c\">\u0110\u1ed9i ng\u0169 s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o c\u1ee7a Lemon s\u1ebd b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u vi\u1ebft k\u1ecbch b\u1ea3n n\u1ed9i dung chi ti\u1ebft. Giai \u0111o\u1ea1n n\u00e0y th\u01b0\u1eddng di\u1ec5n ra trong kho\u1ea3ng 3 ng\u00e0y sau khi k\u00fd h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ed3ng.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-Q5D5dO9D5oOqmExcwe3lgvHVgzb\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 4: T\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t v\u00e0 quay phim<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R8WXdt2TYofuYAxDKz2lVlmSgqb\">Sau khi k\u1ecbch b\u1ea3n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ph\u00ea duy\u1ec7t, \u0111\u1ed9i ng\u0169 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t s\u1ebd ti\u1ebfn h\u00e0nh quay d\u1ef1ng t\u1ea1i studio.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-VdDRdekrEoAHEAxmXEbl1Zh3g2g\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 5: D\u1ef1ng phim, h\u1eadu k\u1ef3 v\u00e0 ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZNsxdASd2oF6CTxFsXql4Kr4gDf\">Video th\u00f4 s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c chuy\u1ec3n qua b\u1ed9 ph\u1eadn h\u1eadu k\u1ef3 \u0111\u1ec3 d\u1ef1ng phim, th\u00eam hi\u1ec7u \u1ee9ng, \u00e2m thanh v\u00e0 ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-Bh7odEvCLo6VPUxfhWolGhWmg9b\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 6: G\u1eedi video, ti\u1ebfp nh\u1eadn ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i v\u00e0 b\u00e0n giao<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-H7t7dHqbTocERKxyTy3lEepzg7g\">Ch\u00fang t\u00f4i s\u1ebd g\u1eedi video b\u1ea3n final cho kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng xem tr\u01b0\u1edbc v\u00e0 ti\u1ebfp nh\u1eadn ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda (n\u1ebfu c\u00f3). Qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t v\u00e0 g\u1eedi video ho\u00e0n ch\u1ec9nh th\u01b0\u1eddng m\u1ea5t t\u1eeb 3-5 ng\u00e0y cho m\u1ed7i video, sau khi k\u1ecbch b\u1ea3n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c duy\u1ec7t.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RfaDdY8KBoYG0ix5SC1l8h66gkd\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-QgHgdpLvwo6Q8pxVWgRlPVP5gUd\">T\u1ea1i sao n\u00ean ch\u1ecdn Lemon Digital \u0111\u1ec3 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t video TikTok?<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZXpndXowioi09yxuPl8l4LlSgib\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-W8FqdRgW2osYW6x7pPWla33gg3g\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;202f38cc-2a9a-4ae0-b3c6-356ca08ed523&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FLwgrbdPhkoxbUKxxpsElybLlgBc%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;LwgrbdPhkoxbUKxxpsElybLlgBc&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:582258,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5445\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5445\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5445\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/53e1e201-c21b-4f15-9dad-48d3b29e1ea4.png\" alt=\"T\u1ea1i sao n\u00ean ch\u1ecdn Lemon Digital \u0111\u1ec3 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t video TikTok?\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/53e1e201-c21b-4f15-9dad-48d3b29e1ea4.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/53e1e201-c21b-4f15-9dad-48d3b29e1ea4-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/53e1e201-c21b-4f15-9dad-48d3b29e1ea4-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/53e1e201-c21b-4f15-9dad-48d3b29e1ea4-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/53e1e201-c21b-4f15-9dad-48d3b29e1ea4-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5445\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>T\u1ea1i sao n\u00ean ch\u1ecdn Lemon Digital \u0111\u1ec3 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t video TikTok?<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"TdBHdYd8GoqF7WxvNr9lNbqYgmb\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HG7udKaGMoU5nYx0nBtlEcsUgRe\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IIgKd6ENCocx19xi6oAlKQPDgHe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Am hi\u1ec3u n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng:<\/strong> Ch\u00fang t\u00f4i \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o n\u1ed9i dung video tu\u00e2n th\u1ee7 ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch c\u1ee7a TikTok, gi\u00fap doanh nghi\u1ec7p x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng k\u00eanh m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I44id8xl7oSdqdxB9YflVXk0gZA\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>T\u1eadp trung v\u00e0o hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 kinh doanh:<\/strong> D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 c\u1ee7a ch\u00fang t\u00f4i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 ph\u1ee5c v\u1ee5 c\u00e1c m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau kinh doanh r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng nh\u01b0 t\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed9 nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n, t\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem v\u00e0 t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jkd5dU2ufor2BTxlm73lh54cgPh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Quy tr\u00ecnh chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p:<\/strong> V\u1edbi quy tr\u00ecnh r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng v\u00e0 minh b\u1ea1ch, ch\u00fang t\u00f4i cam k\u1ebft v\u1ec1 ti\u1ebfn \u0111\u1ed9 v\u00e0 ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FsOXdWHXpobDlgxdFtKlyrYvgBb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Kinh nghi\u1ec7m v\u00e0 uy t\u00edn:<\/strong> Lemon Digital t\u1ef1 h\u00e0o l\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c c\u1ee7a nhi\u1ec1u th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u l\u1edbn nh\u01b0 Viettel Store, FPT University, Cetaphil, L&#8217;angfarm, Bifina, v\u00e0 nhi\u1ec1u doanh nghi\u1ec7p kh\u00e1c.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NuLYdMaSDoSXyHxFw0blIacNgFb\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ALmidQ629ou5yAx7e8AlNvKYgGb\">Trong m\u1ed9t s\u00e2n ch\u01a1i \u0111\u1ea7y c\u1ea1nh tranh nh\u01b0 TikTok, vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 v\u00e0o s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t video chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p kh\u00f4ng c\u00f2n l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn, m\u00e0 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t b\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111i chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh s\u1ef1 th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng c\u1ee7a th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u. M\u1ed9t video \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 b\u00e0i b\u1ea3n kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n thu h\u00fat s\u1ef1 ch\u00fa \u00fd m\u00e0 c\u00f2n x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng ni\u1ec1m tin, truy\u1ec1n t\u1ea3i th\u00f4ng \u0111i\u1ec7p hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 v\u00e0 th\u00fac \u0111\u1ea9y tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp v\u00e0o m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau doanh s\u1ed1.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EvyPdQKa0o2zlYxQrELlffhigLh\">V\u1edbi quy tr\u00ecnh l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng, s\u1ef1 am hi\u1ec3u s\u00e2u s\u1eafc v\u1ec1 n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng v\u00e0 kinh nghi\u1ec7m h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c c\u00f9ng nhi\u1ec1u nh\u00e3n h\u00e0ng l\u1edbn, <strong>Lemon Digital<\/strong> t\u1ef1 tin l\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh \u0111\u00e1ng tin c\u1eady, s\u1eb5n s\u00e0ng bi\u1ebfn nh\u1eefng \u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n th\u00e0nh nh\u1eefng video TikTok s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3. H\u00e3y li\u00ean h\u1ec7 v\u1edbi ch\u00fang t\u00f4i ngay h\u00f4m nay \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u n\u00e2ng t\u1ea7m th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n tr\u00ean TikTok.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z68LdEe2Zo8BeRxVdmGlgEL1gSf\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QBE6dtWYlopuLWxgkEjlrJGBghs\">\n<div data-page-id=\"V0Kidqy2IocGzOxLzIxlADkBgoc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FnMpdlmeroUMmBxzO45lyb2Lg8f\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CiNPdL9yGogrOWx5SP9lClWZgQe\"><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BXbIdAJxhoMK78xlitmlwna7gJi\"><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D4zHdkc9moG0p4xCDsMlPfuCgLg\"><strong>Email: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I1zOdpTlKoctbZx2CeclelbEgNe\"><strong>Website: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PLSVdBWXkoC8WCxZhallVoJrgfc\"><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Trong b\u1ed1i c\u1ea3nh TikTok \u0111\u00e3 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t k\u00eanh b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 marketing \u0111\u1ea7y quy\u1ec1n n\u0103ng, vi\u1ec7c ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u0103ng t\u1ea3i nh\u1eefng video ng\u1eabu h\u1ee9ng \u0111\u00e3 kh\u00f4ng c\u00f2n \u0111\u1ee7 s\u1ee9c c\u1ea1nh tranh. \u0110\u1ec3 th\u1ef1c s\u1ef1 n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt v\u00e0 chinh ph\u1ee5c kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, c\u00e1c doanh nghi\u1ec7p c\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ebfn m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c n\u1ed9i dung b\u00e0i b\u1ea3n v\u00e0 chuy\u00ean [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":5715,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[29,1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-5440","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-kien-thuc-tiktok","category-tin-tuc"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5440","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/5"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=5440"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5440\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5678,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5440\/revisions\/5678"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/5715"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=5440"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=5440"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=5440"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}